* Bio launchpad EVM audits
** C-01 vestingDuration as timestamp
*** Curation.claim passes a Unix time as seconds
*** Vesting contract expects duration in seconds
*** Lesson: units at every contract seam
** H-02 one-wei donation DoS
*** updateFundraiser requires balanceOf == expected
*** Front-run with 1 wei bricks the launch forever
*** Lesson: never == on balanceOf, prefer >= and accounting
** M-01 partial transfer burns the claim
*** _safeClaimTransfer sends min(amount, balance)
*** hasClaimed set before transfer, vesting underfunded
*** Lesson: all-or-nothing claims, no silent clamping
** Also in the reports
*** H-01 cap bypass via non-decremented counter
*** M-01 wrong denominator after unpledge
*** FYEO V2: initializers, admin sweep, tax bounds
